From fe8bb9b6b2ef6de73068d5a04ef95ea9edd4128a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vahidaskari1365 <250786241+vahidaskari1365@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 08:08:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(marketplace): customer second-hand ads + live vendor
 bridge + precise per-parcel tracking
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Second-hand ads: customers post used-product listings from /account/ads
  (or the public /second-hand page) using the REAL catalog categories;
  ads persist in localStorage, render with an 'آگهی تو' badge, support
  mark-sold/delete, honest heart saves (no wishlist pollution) and a
  computed discount stat. New data layer src/data/localSecondHandAds.ts (+7 tests).
- Tracking precision: per-parcel status + status history
  (src/lib/orderTracking.ts), deterministic step dates (6h/26h/74h),
  multi-store orders track each parcel separately; checkout really
  validates address fields now and captures destination/pay/shipping
  into the order; success page shows an honest status tone.
- Vendor bridge: orders buyers place appear in /vendor/orders
  ('سفارش خریدار') and vendor advance writes straight back into the
  buyer's tracking; vendor store edits (name/cover/logo/policies) and
  session-added products now surface on the public /stores/[slug] page;
  buyer seeds cleaned to single-store parcels; stats and charts derive
  from real orders (hydration-safe).
- Honesty sweep: dead /projects cards fixed (id-or-slug), add-to-cart
  uses the selected offer price (displayed price = cart price), real
  category counts in header mega/search/category hero, admin cards
  derive from the catalog with honest 'sample' labels, fake confirm
  buttons (profile save, data download, copy/share, AI result edit,
  continue design) now do the real thing, persisted settings toggles,
  hydration-safe header counters, footer link fixes, producer brand
  seeds the vendor panel.

No visual redesign: every page keeps its exact existing design language.

Checks: eslint 0 · tsc 0 errors · vitest 35/35 · next build ok
